[Summary: Moonlight PSP Core]
This repository constitutes an experimental, work-in-progress port of the Moonlight Game Streaming Client architecture targeting the Sony PlayStation Portable (MIPS R4000). Active testing is restricted to emulator usage (PPSSPP) with critical network features remaining in a debug state.

